# Environment files. `.env` itself is written by Lovable Cloud and holds only
# public values (the Supabase URL and publishable key, which ship in the
# browser bundle anyway). Anything else, especially secrets, must never be
# committed; src/test/env-safety.test.ts fails the build if `.env` gains one.
.env.*
!.env.example
